<ul>
  <li><a href="https://jekyllrb.com/docs/home">Jekyll官方文档</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://mmistakes.github.io/minimal-mistakes/">Minimal Mistakes主题文档</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://docs.github.com/en/pages">GitHub Pages文档</a></li>
</ul>]]></content><author><name>Life OF HERE</name><email>lifeofhere@163.com</email></author><category term="tech" /><category term="jekyll" /><category term="jekyll" /><category term="blog" /><category term="建站" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[使用Jekyll和Minimal Mistakes主题搭建个人博客的入门指南。]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">从零开始搭建GitHub博客：Jekyll + Minimal Mistakes完整指南</title><link href="https://lifeofhere.github.io/tech/blog/github-blog-setup/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="从零开始搭建GitHub博客：Jekyll + Minimal Mistakes完整指南" /><published>2025-01-02T10:00:00+08:00</published><updated>2025-01-02T10:00:00+08:00</updated><id>https://lifeofhere.github.io/tech/blog/github-blog-setup</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://lifeofhere.github.io/tech/blog/github-blog-setup/"><![CDATA[<p>今天成功搭建了基于GitHub Pages的个人博客，使用Jekyll静态网站生成器和Minimal Mistakes主题。整个过程虽然遇到了一些挑战，但最终实现了理想的效果。在这里记录完整的搭建过程，希望能帮助到有同样需求的朋友。</p>

<h2 id="项目架构设计">项目架构设计</h2>

<h3 id="双仓库架构">双仓库架构</h3>

<p>为了保护源代码隐私同时享受GitHub Pages的免费托管，我采用了双仓库架构：</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>私有仓库</strong> (<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">blog-source</code>)：存储Jekyll源代码、配置文件和文章原稿</li>
  <li><strong>公开仓库</strong> (<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">lifeofhere.github.io</code>)：存储构建后的静态网站文件</li>
</ul>

<p>这种架构的优势：</p>
<ul>
  <li>✅ 源代码保持私有</li>
  <li>✅ 享受GitHub Pages免费托管</li>
  <li>✅ 自动化部署流程</li>
  <li>✅ 版本控制和协作支持</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="技术栈选择">技术栈选择</h2>

<h3 id="jekyll--minimal-mistakes">Jekyll + Minimal Mistakes</h3>

<p><strong>Jekyll</strong> 是GitHub Pages官方支持的静态网站生成器，具有以下优势：</p>
<ul>
  <li>原生支持Markdown</li>
  <li>丰富的插件生态</li>
  <li>与GitHub Pages无缝集成</li>
  <li>活跃的社区支持</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Minimal Mistakes</strong> 是一个功能丰富的Jekyll主题：</p>
<ul>
  <li>响应式设计</li>
  <li>SEO优化</li>
  <li>多种布局选项</li>
  <li>社交媒体集成</li>
  <li>评论系统支持</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="搭建过程详解">搭建过程详解</h2>

<h3 id="1-初始化jekyll项目">1. 初始化Jekyll项目</h3>

<div class="language-bash highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="c"># 创建新的Jekyll站点</span>
jekyll new blog
<span class="nb">cd </span>blog

<span class="c"># 安装依赖</span>
bundle <span class="nb">install</span>

<span class="c"># 本地预览</span>
bundle <span class="nb">exec </span>jekyll serve
</code></pre></div></div>

<h3 id="2-配置github-actions工作流">2. 配置GitHub Actions工作流</h3>

<p>创建 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">.github/workflows/pages.yml</code> 文件，实现自动化部署：</p>

<div class="language-yaml highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="na">name</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">Build and Deploy to GitHub Pages</span>

<span class="na">on</span><span class="pi">:</span>
  <span class="na">push</span><span class="pi">:</span>
    <span class="na">branches</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="pi">[</span> <span class="nv">main</span> <span class="pi">]</span>
  <span class="na">pull_request</span><span class="pi">:</span>
    <span class="na">branches</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="pi">[</span> <span class="nv">main</span> <span class="pi">]</span>

<span class="na">permissions</span><span class="pi">:</span>
  <span class="na">contents</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">read</span>
  <span class="na">pages</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">write</span>
  <span class="na">id-token</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">write</span>

<span class="na">jobs</span><span class="pi">:</span>
  <span class="na">build-and-deploy</span><span class="pi">:</span>
    <span class="na">runs-on</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">ubuntu-latest</span>
    <span class="na">steps</span><span class="pi">:</span>
      <span class="pi">-</span> <span class="na">name</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">Checkout</span>
        <span class="na">uses</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">actions/checkout@v4</span>
        
      <span class="pi">-</span> <span class="na">name</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">Setup Ruby</span>
        <span class="na">uses</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">ruby/setup-ruby@v1</span>
        <span class="na">with</span><span class="pi">:</span>
          <span class="na">ruby-version</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s1">'</span><span class="s">3.2'</span>
          <span class="na">bundler-cache</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="no">true</span>
          
      <span class="pi">-</span> <span class="na">name</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">Build site</span>
        <span class="na">run</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">bundle exec jekyll build</span>
        
      <span class="pi">-</span> <span class="na">name</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">Deploy to GitHub Pages</span>
        <span class="na">uses</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">peaceiris/actions-gh-pages@v3</span>
        <span class="na">with</span><span class="pi">:</span>
          <span class="na">personal_token</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">$</span>
          <span class="na">external_repository</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">lifeofhere/lifeofhere.github.io</span>
          <span class="na">publish_branch</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">main</span>
          <span class="na">publish_dir</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">./_site</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<h3 id="3-添加minimal-mistakes主题">3. 添加Minimal Mistakes主题</h3>

<h4 id="更新gemfile">更新Gemfile</h4>

<div class="language-ruby highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="n">source</span> <span class="s2">"https://rubygems.org"</span>

<span class="n">gem</span> <span class="s2">"github-pages"</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="ss">group: :jekyll_plugins</span>
<span class="n">gem</span> <span class="s2">"minimal-mistakes-jekyll"</span>

<span class="n">group</span> <span class="ss">:jekyll_plugins</span> <span class="k">do</span>
  <span class="n">gem</span> <span class="s2">"jekyll-feed"</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="s2">"~&gt; 0.12"</span>
  <span class="n">gem</span> <span class="s2">"jekyll-include-cache"</span>
<span class="k">end</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<h4 id="配置_configyml">配置_config.yml</h4>

<div class="language-yaml highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="c1"># 主题配置</span>
<span class="na">theme</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">minimal-mistakes-jekyll</span>
<span class="na">remote_theme</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s2">"</span><span class="s">mmistakes/minimal-mistakes@4.24.0"</span>

<span class="c1"># 网站基本信息</span>
<span class="na">title</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s2">"</span><span class="s">Life</span><span class="nv"> </span><span class="s">OF</span><span class="nv"> </span><span class="s">HERE"</span>
<span class="na">email</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s2">"</span><span class="s">lifeofhere@163.com"</span>
<span class="na">description</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s2">"</span><span class="s">技术分享与生活记录"</span>
<span class="na">baseurl</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s2">"</span><span class="s">"</span>
<span class="na">url</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s2">"</span><span class="s">https://lifeofhere.github.io"</span>

<span class="c1"># 作者信息</span>
<span class="na">author</span><span class="pi">:</span>
  <span class="na">name</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s2">"</span><span class="s">Life</span><span class="nv"> </span><span class="s">OF</span><span class="nv"> </span><span class="s">HERE"</span>
  <span class="na">avatar</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s2">"</span><span class="s">/assets/images/avatar.jpg"</span>
  <span class="na">bio</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s2">"</span><span class="s">技术爱好者，终身学习者"</span>
  <span class="na">location</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s2">"</span><span class="s">China"</span>
  <span class="na">email</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s2">"</span><span class="s">lifeofhere@163.com"</span>
  <span class="na">links</span><span class="pi">:</span>
    <span class="pi">-</span> <span class="na">label</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s2">"</span><span class="s">GitHub"</span>
      <span class="na">icon</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s2">"</span><span class="s">fab</span><span class="nv"> </span><span class="s">fa-fw</span><span class="nv"> </span><span class="s">fa-github"</span>
      <span class="na">url</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s2">"</span><span class="s">https://github.com/lifeofhere"</span>

<span class="c1"># 插件配置</span>
<span class="na">plugins</span><span class="pi">:</span>
  <span class="pi">-</span> <span class="s">jekyll-paginate</span>
  <span class="pi">-</span> <span class="s">jekyll-sitemap</span>
  <span class="pi">-</span> <span class="s">jekyll-gist</span>
  <span class="pi">-</span> <span class="s">jekyll-feed</span>
  <span class="pi">-</span> <span class="s">jekyll-include-cache</span>

<span class="c1"># 默认布局</span>
<span class="na">defaults</span><span class="pi">:</span>
  <span class="pi">-</span> <span class="na">scope</span><span class="pi">:</span>
      <span class="na">path</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s2">"</span><span class="s">"</span>
      <span class="na">type</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">posts</span>
    <span class="na">values</span><span class="pi">:</span>
      <span class="na">layout</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">single</span>
      <span class="na">author_profile</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="no">true</span>
      <span class="na">read_time</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="no">true</span>
      <span class="na">comments</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="no">true</span>
      <span class="na">share</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="no">true</span>
      <span class="na">related</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="no">true</span>
      <span class="na">show_date</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="no">true</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<h3 id="4-创建页面结构">4. 创建页面结构</h3>

<h4 id="导航配置-_datanavigationyml">导航配置 (_data/navigation.yml)</h4>

<div class="language-yaml highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="na">main</span><span class="pi">:</span>
  <span class="pi">-</span> <span class="na">title</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s2">"</span><span class="s">首页"</span>
    <span class="na">url</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">/</span>
  <span class="pi">-</span> <span class="na">title</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s2">"</span><span class="s">关于"</span>
    <span class="na">url</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">/about/</span>
  <span class="pi">-</span> <span class="na">title</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s2">"</span><span class="s">文章分类"</span>
    <span class="na">url</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">/categories/</span>
  <span class="pi">-</span> <span class="na">title</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s2">"</span><span class="s">标签"</span>
    <span class="na">url</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">/tags/</span>
  <span class="pi">-</span> <span class="na">title</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s2">"</span><span class="s">归档"</span>
    <span class="na">url</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">/year-archive/</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<h4 id="创建功能页面">创建功能页面</h4>

<ul>
  <li><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">_pages/about.md</code> - 关于页面</li>
  <li><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">_pages/category-archive.md</code> - 分类页面</li>
  <li><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">_pages/tag-archive.md</code> - 标签页面</li>
  <li><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">_pages/year-archive.md</code> - 归档页面</li>
</ul>

<h3 id="5-优化首页布局">5. 优化首页布局</h3>

<p>更新 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">index.markdown</code>，添加特色区域和现代化布局：</p>

<div class="language-yaml highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="nn">---</span>
<span class="na">layout</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">home</span>
<span class="na">author_profile</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="no">true</span>
<span class="na">header</span><span class="pi">:</span>
  <span class="na">overlay_color</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s2">"</span><span class="s">#000"</span>
  <span class="na">overlay_filter</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s2">"</span><span class="s">0.5"</span>
  <span class="na">overlay_image</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">/assets/images/header-bg.jpg</span>
  <span class="na">actions</span><span class="pi">:</span>
    <span class="pi">-</span> <span class="na">label</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s2">"</span><span class="s">了解更多"</span>
      <span class="na">url</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s2">"</span><span class="s">/about/"</span>
<span class="na">excerpt</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s2">"</span><span class="s">欢迎来到我的个人博客！这里记录着我的技术学习心得、生活感悟和思考分享。"</span>
<span class="nn">---</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<h2 id="遇到的问题与解决方案">遇到的问题与解决方案</h2>

<h3 id="1-github-actions部署失败">1. GitHub Actions部署失败</h3>

<p><strong>问题</strong>：”not found deploy key or tokens” 错误</p>

<p><strong>解决方案</strong>：</p>
<ol>
  <li>创建Personal Access Token（需要<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">repo</code>和<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">workflow</code>权限）</li>
  <li>在私有仓库中添加<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN</code>密钥</li>
  <li>确保目标仓库存在且为公开状态</li>
</ol>

<h3 id="2-主题样式不生效">2. 主题样式不生效</h3>

<p><strong>问题</strong>：页面显示简单样式，主题特性未加载</p>

<p><strong>解决方案</strong>：</p>
<ol>
  <li>修复layout配置（将<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">page</code>改为<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">single</code>）</li>
  <li>更新依赖：<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">bundle update</code></li>
  <li>重启Jekyll服务器</li>
</ol>

<h3 id="3-构建警告处理">3. 构建警告处理</h3>

<p><strong>问题</strong>：Layout ‘page’ requested but does not exist</p>

<p><strong>解决方案</strong>：</p>
<ul>
  <li>将所有使用<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">layout: page</code>的文件改为<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">layout: single</code></li>
  <li>确保所有页面使用Minimal Mistakes支持的布局</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="部署配置要点">部署配置要点</h2>

<h3 id="personal-access-token设置">Personal Access Token设置</h3>

<ol>
  <li>访问GitHub Settings → Developer settings → Personal access tokens</li>
  <li>创建新token，选择以下权限：
    <ul>
      <li><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">repo</code> (完整仓库访问权限)</li>
      <li><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">workflow</code> (工作流权限)</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li>在私有仓库Settings → Secrets中添加<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN</code></li>
</ol>

<h3 id="github-pages配置">GitHub Pages配置</h3>

<ol>
  <li>在公开仓库Settings → Pages中</li>
  <li>Source选择”Deploy from a branch”</li>
  <li>Branch选择<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">main</code>分支</li>
  <li>保存配置</li>
</ol>

